[E-NOT-A-TYPE] Error: expected a type
   ╭─[ reject/if-h-on-bool.sw:5:67 ]
   │
 5 │ theorem choose (b: Bool): Or (b = True) (Not (b = True)) := if h: b then Inl h else Inr h
   │                                                                   ┬  
   │                                                                   ╰── this has type `Bool`, so it isn't a type
   │ 
   │ Note: `if h: P` needs a proposition `P`; for a `Bool` `c`, write `if c then … else …`, or `if h: c = True then … else …` to have `h: c = True` in the branches
